1
00:00:00,500 --> 00:00:05,400
An AI application can fail between a request, a response and the next action.

2
00:00:05,400 --> 00:00:08,980
When the context is scattered, finding the cause takes time.

3
00:00:09,600 --> 00:00:13,300
BlackBox records selected activity for supported integrations,

4
00:00:13,300 --> 00:00:16,080
helping you inspect the evidence when something goes wrong.

5
00:00:16,700 --> 00:00:19,140
Instead of starting with disconnected clues,

6
00:00:19,140 --> 00:00:22,880
review what was recorded in one place, and see where the record ends.

7
00:00:23,500 --> 00:00:26,870
Follow the sequence through a request, response and interruption.

8
00:00:26,870 --> 00:00:30,280
BlackBox shows what it observed, and what it cannot establish.

9
00:00:30,900 --> 00:00:33,570
The diagnosis connects findings to the evidence,

10
00:00:33,570 --> 00:00:38,380
separating observed facts from possible explanations and unanswered questions.

11
00:00:39,000 --> 00:00:41,310
Prepare a brief for your coding assistant.

12
00:00:41,310 --> 00:00:46,580
Review a proposed change, approve it explicitly, and see the result of the checks you choose.

13
00:00:47,200 --> 00:00:50,020
When the next incident happens, start with evidence.

14
00:00:50,020 --> 00:00:54,880
BlackBox helps you see more clearly, and decide what comes next.
